%description:

Tests that VlanIndMapper classifies the frames received on the access ports of
a VLAN-aware bridge into the VLAN of the port, as the port VLAN id (PVID) based
classification of IEEE 802.1Q-2018 clause 6.9.1 f does. The network and the
traffic are described in lib/vlan-access-trunk.ini: two bridges joined by a
trunk, VLAN 10 with the hosts a1, a2 and a3, and VLAN 20 with b1 and b2, where
a1 and b1, and a3 and b2, use the same MAC address.

Every receiver must get all of its data. The tag inserter of bridge1 must tag
frames with VLAN 10 and with VLAN 20, which it only does on the trunk, because
the hosts of the access ports have no 802.1Q layer and cannot receive tagged
frames. a2 sends priority-tagged frames, and the inbound mapper of bridge1
must classify them into VLAN 10.

The frame counts at the hosts check that each VLAN is a forwarding domain of
its own. Each count equals the count of the same host in a network where the
two VLANs are two separate pairs of plain switches without any VLAN
configuration, and a2 sends untagged frames: no frame crosses from one VLAN to
the other, broadcasts included, and no unicast frame is flooded to a host it
is not addressed to once its destination is learned.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
include ../../lib/vlan-access-trunk.ini

%subst: /\x1B\[[0-9;]*m//

%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a1.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 27
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a2.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 27
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b1.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 26
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a3.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 98
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b2.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 49
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a3.app[0] packetReceived:sum(packetBytes) 131072
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b2.app[0] packetReceived:sum(packetBytes) 65536
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 10.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 20.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a2.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 0.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.bridging.vlanPolicy.inboundMapper: Mapping VLAN id, interfaceName = eth1, receivedVlanId = 0, mappedVlanId = 10.
